dy, so on that seed the free table looks like it fit cap-6 distances late in training in a way that does not survive 7+-line chains, the far-bucket drift risk registered; the two seeds whose minima matched 115 scored +22/+33. Follow-ups: freeze or shrink the far log buckets, or give the table a much lower LR than the embeddings (Adam moves rarely-used far entries by a full step each update); any keep needs the fused-kernel step cost fixed first (bias gradient through a separate cheap path). The other agent's 116-claude learned per-block slopes (24 params) is the constrained version of this idea and was running concurrently.",
